  m_text: "<margin-left=1em>  \u2022<indent=1.2em> The player must decide when to
    cash out before the balloon flies off. If you cash out at the right moment, your
    bet is multiplied by the current multiplier. If the balloon flies off first,
    you lose your bet.</indent></margin></indent></margin>"
